; ====================================================================
; CAU HINH TESTER CHO WonderwhalesXAU2ModeEA (XAUUSD / Vang) - wonderwhales_xau_2mode_scalp
; Du an: MT5 EA & AI Lab (tm-fx)
; File: docs/20-operations/presets/wonderwhales_xau_2mode_scalp.set
; Nguon: configs/demo/wonderwhales_xau_2mode_demo.json (JSON la nguon su that).
; Che do:
;   InpTradingMode=1 (1=SCALP, 2=SWING).
;   Gia tri rieng theo che do (risk, TP R, BE/trail trigger, cooldown) dat o day.
; Quy uoc: chi tai khoan DEMO va Strategy Tester (ADR 0009). InpRequireParity=true
;   chan moi entry (parity_blocked) cho toi khi parity Pine<->MT5 duoc chung minh.
; ====================================================================

